{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f6f3f0;--card:#fff;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#6a7b72;--accent-2:#b08a6a;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.65)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue';background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf9f7 0%,#f2efe9 100%);color:#222}
    /* subtle, bespoke SVG texture */
    .pattern{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.12;background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='400' height='400' viewBox='0 0 400 400'><defs><pattern id='p' width='40' height='40' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><rect width='40' height='40' fill='%23fff7f2'/><g stroke='%23bfb7ab' stroke-opacity='0.12' stroke-width='1'><path d='M0 20 Q10 0 20 20 T40 20' fill='none'/><path d='M20 0 L20 40' stroke-opacity='0.06'/></g></pattern></defs><rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(%23p)'/></svg>");}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px;position:relative}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    .brand p{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a.cta{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent) 0%,var(--accent-2) 100%);color:#fff}
    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;margin-top:22px}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(29,27,25,0.06)}
    h2{margin:0 0 8px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 16px}
    /* Contact form */
    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#444}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e2de;background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    button.secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e6e2de;color:#444}
    /* Sidebar mini features */
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .box{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),#fff)}
    .seat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
    .seat button{padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px}
    .packing{margin-top:12px}
    ul.pack{padding-left:18px}
    /* Modal */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,8,7,0.36);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .modal{width:540px;background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(20,20,20,0.25);max-width:95%}
    .modal h3{margin-top:0}
    .pulse{height:120px;width:120px;border-radius:999px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(106,123,114,0.18),transparent 30%),linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(176,138,106,0.12), rgba(106,123,114,0.06));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:14px auto}
    .timer{font-size:22px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    /* responsiveness */
    @media (max-width:880px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav{display:none}}  
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern" aria-hidden></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
        <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Offerings</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investments</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="cta">Reach Out</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <h2 id="contact-heading">Connect with our circle</h2>
        <p class="lead">Use this page to ask about events, private gatherings, or to share an intention ahead of a session. We reply with thoughtful timing — usually within one business day.</p>

        <form id="contactForm" novalidate>
          <div class="row">
            <label style="flex:1">
              Your name
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="First & last" required>
            </label>
            <label style="width:220px">
              Phone
              <input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
            </label>
          </div>

          <label>
            Email
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>
          </label>

          <label>
            Message
            <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us how we can support you (dates, group size, accessibility needs)"></textarea>
          </label>

          <div class="actions">
            <button type="submit">Send a note</button>
            <button type="button" class="secondary" id="tryNowBtn">Try a short practice</button>
            <span class="muted">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></span>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:#555">
          <strong>Contraindications:</strong> Sound bathing can be calming and restorative, but it may not be suitable for everyone. If you are pregnant, have a history of seizures, epilepsy, severe heart conditions, or use a pacemaker, please consult your physician before attending. If you have sensory sensitivities, let us know—some accommodations are available. This page does not replace medical advice.
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="panel">
        <div class="box">
          <h3>Sample event seat selector</h3>
          <p class="small">Pick seats for a hypothetical next gathering. This demo keeps everything local (no booking will be made).</p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <label class="small">Select event</label>
            <select id="eventSelect">
              <option value="fullmoon">Full Moon Lull — Sat 7pm</option>
              <option value="weekday">Midweek Ease — Wed 6pm</option>
              <option value="morning">Morning Reset — Sun 9am</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="seat">
            <div>
              <label class="small">Seats</label>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
                <button id="seatDown" aria-label="Decrease seats">–</button>
                <div id="seatCount" style="min-width:48px;text-align:center;font-weight:600">1</div>
                <button id="seatUp" aria-label="Increase seats">+</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1">
              <label class="small">Available</label>
              <div id="availability" style="font-weight:600;margin-top:6px;color:#3a7b5d">—</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="packing">
            <label class="small">Preferences (affect suggestions)</label>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-top:8px">
              <label><input type="checkbox" id="bringMat" checked> I’ll bring a mat</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" id="bringBlanket"> I like a warm blanket</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" id="bringJournal"> I’ll journal afterwards</label>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px"><button id="generatePack">What should I bring?</button></div>
            <div id="packResults" style="margin-top:10px"></div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button id="reserveBtn">Reserve (local)</button>
            <button id="clearBtn" class="secondary">Clear</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="box">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Contact info</h4>
          <div class="small">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div class="small">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="muted">Prefer live help? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — our office hours are weekdays. Thank you for reaching out.</div>
    </footer>

  </div>

  <!-- Try-it modal (guided practice) -->
  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modalBackdrop" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document" aria-labelledby="modalTitle">
      <h3 id="modalTitle">A short anchoring practice</h3>
      <p class="small">Three minutes: breathing, a micro-journal, and a settling intention. Use this once to test the rhythm; it's purely local.</p>

      <div class="pulse" id="pulse">
        <div class="timer" id="timer">Ready</div>
      </div>

      <div id="modalControls" style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-top:6px">
        <button id="startPractice">Start 3-minute flow</button>
        <button id="stepPractice" class="secondary">Step-by-step</button>
        <button id="closeModal" class="secondary">Close</button>
      </div>

      <div id="practiceStage" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Seeded pseudo-random (linear congruential) so availability is deterministic by seed + event
    (function(){
      function LCG(seed){this._s = seed >>> 0}
      LCG.prototype.next = function(){this._s = (1664525 * this._s + 1013904223) >>> 0;return this._s};
      LCG.prototype.float = function(){return this.next() / 4294967295};

      const seed = 2960292377;
      const rng = new LCG(seed);

      const eventSelect = document.getElementById('eventSelect');
      const availability = document.getElementById('availability');
      const seatCountEl = document.getElementById('seatCount');
      const seatUp = document.getElementById('seatUp');
      const seatDown = document.getElementById('seatDown');
      const reserveBtn = document.getElementById('reserveBtn');
      const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clearBtn');
      const generatePack = document.getElementById('generatePack');
      const packResults = document.getElementById('packResults');
      const bringMat = document.getElementById('bringMat');
      const bringBlanket = document.getElementById('bringBlanket');
      const bringJournal = document.getElementById('bringJournal');

      // deterministic availability by event key
      function computeAvailability(key){
        // derive a small hash
        let h = 2166136261 >>> 0;
        for(let i=0;i<key.length;i++){h = Math.imul(h ^ key.charCodeAt(i), 16777619) >>> 0}
        const r = new LCG(h).float();
        const cap = 24; // fixed capacity
        const avail = Math.max(0, Math.floor(cap * (0.25 + r * 0.7))); // between 25% and 95%
        return {capacity:cap,available:avail};
      }

      function refreshAvailability(){
        const key = eventSelect.value;
        const data = computeAvailability(key);
        availability.textContent = data.available + ' / ' + data.capacity + ' seats open';
        // ensure seatCount in range
        const cur = Number(seatCountEl.textContent)||1;
        const newVal = Math.min(Math.max(1,cur), Math.max(1,data.available));
        seatCountEl.textContent = newVal;
      }

      eventSelect.addEventListener('change', refreshAvailability);
      seatUp.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        let cur = Number(seatCountEl.textContent) || 1;
        const avail = Number(availability.textContent.split(' ')[0]) || 1;
        if(cur < avail) cur++;
        seatCountEl.textContent = cur;
      });
      seatDown.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        let cur = Number(seatCountEl.textContent) || 1;
        if(cur>1) cur--;
        seatCountEl.textContent = cur;
      });

      reserveBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const sel = eventSelect.value;
        const seat = Number(seatCountEl.textContent)||1;
        const key = 'demo-reservations';
        const store = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key) || '[]');
        store.push({event:sel,seats:seat,time:Date.now()});
        localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(store));
        alert('Reservation simulated locally for '+seat+' seat(s). No payment or booking was made.');
        refreshAvailability();
      });
      clearBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        localStorage.removeItem('demo-reservations');
        alert('Local demo reservations cleared.');
      });

      generatePack.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const seat = Number(seatCountEl.textContent)||1;
        const items = [];
        items.push('Comfortable mat or cushion');
        items.push('Water bottle');
        if(bringBlanket.checked) items.push('A warm blanket or shawl (recommended)');
        if(bringMat.checked) items.push('A yoga mat or thick pad');
        if(bringJournal.checked) items.push('A small notebook and pen for reflections');
        if(seat>4) items.push('Consider arriving 10–15 minutes early for group setup');
        items.push('Optional: eye mask, socks, small pillow');

        packResults.innerHTML = '<strong>Suggested kit</strong><ul class="pack">'+items.map(i=>'<li>'+i+'</li>').join('')+'</ul>';
      });

      // initialize
      (function(){seatCountEl.textContent='1';refreshAvailability();})();

      // Contact form local demo handler
      document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const fm = new FormData(this);
        const summary = {
          name:fm.get('name'),
          email:fm.get('email'),
          phone:fm.get('phone'),
          message:fm.get('message'),
          time:Date.now()
        };
        // store locally as demo delivery
        const key = 'contact-messages-demo';
        const arr = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key) || '[]');
        arr.push(summary);
        localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(arr));
        alert('Message saved locally. In production this would send to our team. Thank you.');
        this.reset();
      });

      // Guided practice modal
      const modal = document.getElementById('modalBackdrop');
      const tryNowBtn = document.getElementById('tryNowBtn');
      const closeModal = document.getElementById('closeModal');
      const startPractice = document.getElementById('startPractice');
      const stepPractice = document.getElementById('stepPractice');
      const timerEl = document.getElementById('timer');
      const pulse = document.getElementById('pulse');
      const practiceStage = document.getElementById('practiceStage');

      function openModal(){modal.style.display='flex';modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');}
      function hideModal(){modal.style.display='none';modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');resetPractice();}

      tryNowBtn.addEventListener('click', openModal);
      closeModal.addEventListener('click', hideModal);

      // practice engine: 3-phase: breathing (1:00), journaling prompt (1:00), intention & close (1:00)
      let practiceTimer = null;
      function resetPractice(){
        timerEl.textContent='Ready';
        pulse.style.transform='scale(1)';
        practiceStage.innerHTML='';
        if(practiceTimer){clearInterval(practiceTimer);practiceTimer=null}
      }

      function breathPhase(sec){
        practiceStage.innerHTML = '<div class="small">Breathing — follow the circle: inhale, hold, exhale. (4-3-6 pattern)</div>';
        let t = sec; timerEl.textContent = formatTime(t);
        practiceTimer = setInterval(()=>{
          t--; if(t<0){clearInterval(practiceTimer);practiceTimer=null;nextPhase();return}
          // animate pulse proportionally
          const s = 1 + 0.24 * (Math.sin((sec-t)/sec * Math.PI * 2) + 1)/2;
          pulse.style.transform = 'scale('+s+')';
          timerEl.textContent = formatTime(t);
        },1000);
      }

      function journalPhase(sec){
        practiceStage.innerHTML = '<div class="small">Micro-journal — write one sentence about how you feel. You may type it in the box or simply think it.</div><textarea id="microJournal" placeholder="One-line reflection" style="width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ece6df"></textarea>';
        let t = sec; timerEl.textContent = formatTime(t);
        practiceTimer = setInterval(()=>{t--; if(t<0){clearInterval(practiceTimer);practiceTimer=null;nextPhase();return}timerEl.textContent = formatTime(t);},1000);
      }

      function intentionPhase(sec){
        practiceStage.innerHTML = '<div class="small">Set an intention — a single short phrase you can carry with you today.</div><input id="intentionInput" placeholder="I will..." style="width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ece6df">';
        let t = sec; timerEl.textContent = formatTime(t);
        practiceTimer = setInterval(()=>{t--; if(t<0){clearInterval(practiceTimer);practiceTimer=null;finishPractice();return}timerEl.textContent = formatTime(t);},1000);
      }

      function formatTime(s){const m = Math.floor(s/60); const ss = s%60; return (m?m+':':'')+(ss<10?'0'+ss:ss)}

      let phases = [()=>breathPhase(60),()=>journalPhase(60),()=>intentionPhase(60)];
      let current = 0;
      function nextPhase(){current++; if(current<phases.length){phases[current]()} else {finishPractice()}}

      function finishPractice(){practiceStage.innerHTML='<div class="small">All done — carry your intention with ease. Close this window when ready.</div>';timerEl.textContent='Complete'; pulse.style.transform='scale(1)';}

      startPractice.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        current = 0; phases[current]();
      });

      stepPractice.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        // step through: start breathing for 30s so users can try quickly
        breathPhase(30);
      });

      // accessibility: close modal on ESC
      window.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){if(e.key==='Escape') hideModal();});

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page — sound_bath-MORE-2026-02-17T11-48-40-017Z-035

This chunk provides the contact page and a short README for the sound bath project.

Files included:
- contact.html — The interactive contact page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. It includes:
  - A contact form (local-demo; stores messages in localStorage for demo purposes).
  - A deterministic seat selector for a sample event (capacity demo; availability generated with a seeded LCG so results are repeatable).
  - A "What to bring" packing list generator based on seat count and preferences (mat, blanket, journal).
  - A local reservation simulator storing demo reservations in localStorage (no external calls).
  - A guided practice modal: a three-phase micro-routine (breathing, micro-journal, intention). Runs entirely in client-side JS and uses timers and a simple pulsing circle for feedback.
  - A responsible contraindications disclaimer.

Notes and usage:
- Everything runs locally; use the page to preview interaction patterns. In production, change the form handler and reservation flows to your server or booking provider.
- Placeholders present in the HTML that must be replaced by your templating or build system:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

Accessibility and behavior:
- Modal is keyboard-closeable (Escape). Buttons are normal HTML buttons for easier focus handling.
- The guided practice times are short by default (3 phases of 60s); the step mode performs a brief 30s breathing demo.

Implementation details:
- Deterministic availability uses a small seeded LCG to ensure the demo is repeatable across loads (seed: 2960292377).
- Local storage keys used:
  - contact-messages-demo — array of contact messages saved locally
  - demo-reservations — array of local reservations

Integration:
- This file expects the rest of the site pages to exist at the following relative paths: index.html, events.html, private-sessions.html, pricing.html, about.html, faq.html, book.html.
- Visual texture is embedded inline as an SVG data URI to avoid external assets. If you prefer a shared asset file, replace the background with assets/img/pattern.svg.

Developer tips:
- Replace the alert() calls with a nicer in-page toast for production.
- Wire the contact form to your backend / email provider and convert the demo reservation into a proper booking workflow.
- If adding analytics, be mindful of user privacy for demo storage and timers.

